  <item>
    <title>生活就是靠着这些小瞬间，得已苟延残喘... | 10</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dc1c42ee04007d88cbe53f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dc1c42ee04007d88cbe53f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>以秋为饵，垂钩新生...有天早晨我醒来，小张已经去上班了，他很激动的跟我发消息说，他那天闻到了秋天的味道，我疑惑？这么热的天气怎么会有秋天的味道呢？而且秋天是个什么味道呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这件事过去快一个月了，但最近我老想起它...</span></p><span></span><p><span>想起那一瞬间小张闻到的秋天的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span>想起他那么激动的跟我发消息</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么信誓旦旦的表达着一种期待和兴奋</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以生活就是靠着这么一些小小的瞬间得已继续下去的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那这期我来和你们说一说最近这段时间,我体验到的一些值得让我活下去的那些小瞬间...</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 在炎炎盛夏闻到秋天的味道...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 练习游泳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 沉迷动漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a> 和朋友聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 房间整理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a> 和猫相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 吃火鸡面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 修改简历</span></p><span></span><p><span>【了解更多-点击下划线直接跳转】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7885546823" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7885546823"><span>小尹啊小尹-小蚓小蚓</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63e0b03d0000000027035d25?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63e0b03d0000000027035d25&amp;apptime=1721630994&amp;share_id=6a9c68fcf43247b8981f8e1f0d7ae850" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63e0b03d0000000027035d25?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63e0b03d0000000027035d25&amp;apptime=1721630994&amp;share_id=6a9c68fcf43247b8981f8e1f0d7ae850"><span>小尹啊小尹</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播邮箱：1502470097@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿/加听友群：xiaoyin-miya（微信号）</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有想一起录节目的小伙伴，欢迎你作为飞行嘉宾参与试录，如果你觉得跟主播很有话聊，也非常有分享欲，“哟你来啦”欢迎你的加入，如果你想要投稿，可以将你的故事发送到我的邮箱，不管你想说什么，我都有话可以和你聊~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【祝你】</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天也无事发生~</span></p>]]></description>
