  <item>
    <title>变形计之人设、运动、整牙，我现在强得可怕！| 02</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668e43a28fcadceb905265a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668e43a28fcadceb905265a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>曾经的土狗现在的秀逗，是什么让她有了如此大的变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那个曾经坐公交时要下车都不敢跟师傅开口喊“有下”的小女孩；那个曾经胖胖圆圆又土土的小女孩；现在也很好的长大了～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是主播的个人“变形计”深度剖析，当然你也可以获得一些关于运动和整牙的信息差~</span></p><span></span><p><span>不要怕，你现在已经是最棒的成年人啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 是谁胖胖圆圆又土土？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 跑步这么好的运动，为什么止步于22年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 高考结束后最爆火的店你猜是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> 改变第一步：立人设？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> 如果我进了传销组织我一定是销冠吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 原来没钱才是原动力！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> 同质化太多，对选择困难症真的很不友好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 听着播客做运动也没那么难了...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 训记这个APP我强推好吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 为什么大道理都懂，但就是做不到呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">15:18</a> 整牙不亚于整形？真的假的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> 为了整牙，我竟需要拔掉8颗牙齿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 隐形牙套有好有坏？钢牙VS隐形牙套</span></p><span></span><p><span>【了解更多-点击下划线直接跳转】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7885546823" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7885546823"><span>小尹啊小尹-小蚓小蚓</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63e0b03d0000000027035d25?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63e0b03d0000000027035d25&amp;apptime=1721630994&amp;share_id=6a9c68fcf43247b8981f8e1f0d7ae850" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63e0b03d0000000027035d25?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63e0b03d0000000027035d25&amp;apptime=1721630994&amp;share_id=6a9c68fcf43247b8981f8e1f0d7ae850"><span>小尹啊小尹</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播邮箱：1502470097@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿/加听友群：xiaoyin-miya（微信号）</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有想一起录节目的小伙伴，欢迎你作为飞行嘉宾参与试录，如果你觉得跟主播很有话聊，也非常有分享欲，“哟你来啦”欢迎你的加入！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【祝你】</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天也无事发生~</span></p>]]></description>
